            "url": "https://ajie8021.github.io/2026/09/22/hello-world/",
            "title": "博客搭建与美化",
            "date_published": "2026-09-22T09:44:36.973Z",
            "content_html": "<p>欢迎来到我的博客网站，第一篇博文分享一下我的搭建经验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"博客搭建\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#博客搭建\">#</a> 博客搭建</h2>\n<p>我是参考<a href=\"https://blog.gochi.cn/posts/hexo-build/\">如何用Hexo搭建个人博客?</a>和<a href=\"https://18kk18.github.io/2026/04/03/my%20first%20blog/\">关于第一次搭建博客</a>这两篇文章来操作的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"博客美化\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#博客美化\">#</a> 博客美化</h2>\n<h3 id=\"主题选择\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#主题选择\">#</a> 主题选择</h3>\n<p>Hexo提供了很多主题供我们参考参考，详细情况可以看在<a href=\"https://hexo.io/themes/\">Hexo主题</a>进行查看、选择。</p>\n<h3 id=\"shokax-主题\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#shokax-主题\">#</a> shokaX 主题</h3>\n<p>我用的是<a href=\"https://shoka.lostyu.me/\">shokaX</a>主题。</p>\n<h4 id=\"博文推荐\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#博文推荐\">#</a> 博文推荐</h4>\n<p>完整的搭建及安装流程可以参考<a href=\"https://lyrashore.com/computer-science/hexo/shokax/shokax-start/\">Hexo+ShokaX主题+Vercel/Github Pages搭建个人博客</a>这篇文章。</p>\n<h4 id=\"github-链接\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#github-链接\">#</a> Github 链接</h4>\n<p>或者直接下载GitHub<a href=\"https://github.com/theme-shoka-x/hexo-theme-shokaX\">ShokaX安装、配置、部署</a>进行操作。</p>\n<h4 id=\"踩过的坑\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#踩过的坑\">#</a> 踩过的坑</h4>\n<p>在安装过程中难免会遇到一些问题，我罗列一下我遇到的问题以及解决方法，可供参考：</p>\n<h5 id=\"yaml-缩进错误多次\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#yaml-缩进错误多次\">#</a> YAML 缩进错误（多次）</h5>\n<p>现象：</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">$</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> YAMLException:</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> bad</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> indentation</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> can</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> read</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> block</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> mapping</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> entry</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>原因：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>deploy: 被注释掉，type/repository/branch 成了孤儿缩进;</li>\n<li>keywords:program 冒号后没空格;</li>\n<li>混用 Tab 和空格</li>\n</ul>\n<p>解决：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>冒号后必须加空格：keywords: program;</li>\n<li>统一用空格缩进，deploy: 顶格;</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 id=\"渲染器不兼容sxec-104\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#渲染器不兼容sxec-104\">#</a> 渲染器不兼容（SXEC 104）</h5>\n<p>现象：</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">$</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> hexo-renderer-multi-next-markdown-it</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> is</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> supported</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> ShokaX</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> 0.5.2</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> and</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> above,please</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> use</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> hexo-renderer-aether</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> instead.</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>原因：ShokaX 0.5.2+ 要求用 hexo-renderer-aether，旧渲染器还在。</p>\n<p>解决：</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> uninstall</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> hexo-renderer-multi-next-markdown-it</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> uninstall</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> hexo-renderer-multi-markdown-it</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> hexo-renderer-aether</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\"> --save</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>注意有两个旧渲染器，都要卸掉。</p>\n<h5 id=\"高亮引擎冲突sxec-101\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#高亮引擎冲突sxec-101\">#</a> 高亮引擎冲突（SXEC 101）</h5>\n<p>现象：</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">$</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> Highlight.js</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> or</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> Prismjs</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> enabled.</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> The</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> code</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> block</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> will</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> render</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> incomplete.</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>原因：ShokaX 自带代码高亮，与主目录下的_config.yml冲突。</p>\n<p>解决：<br />\n在 _config.yml 里将高光全部关闭：</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">syntax_highlighter:</span><span style=\"color:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD\">        # 设为空，或直接删掉这一行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">highlight.enable:</span><span style=\"color:#1E754F;--shiki-dark:#4D9375\"> false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">prismjs.enable:</span><span style=\"color:#1E754F;--shiki-dark:#4D9375\"> false</span></span></code></pre>\n<h5 id=\"image_list-报错\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#image_list-报错\">#</a> image_list 报错</h5>\n<p>现象：<br />\nHexo 启动/生成页面时报错：</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">$</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> image_list</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> must</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> have</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> at</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> least</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> 6</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> items</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>涉及主题：node_modules/hexo-theme-shokax</p>\n<p>原因：<br />\nShokaX 首页封面配置启用了随机封面：</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">homeConfig:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">  coverConfig:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">    enableCover:</span><span style=\"color:#1E754F;--shiki-dark:#4D9375\"> true</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>而主题要求 image_list 至少包含 6 张图片。</p>\n<p>解决方法：<br />\n在 _config.yml 中配置至少 6 个封面：</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">image_list:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">  -</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> /images/cover1.jpg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">  -</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> /images/cover2.jpg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">  -</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> /images/cover3.jpg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">  -</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> /images/cover4.jpg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">  -</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> /images/cover5.jpg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">  -</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> /images/cover6.jpg</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>并确保这些图片实际存在于：source/images/</p>\n<h5 id=\"音乐播放器报错\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#音乐播放器报错\">#</a> 音乐播放器报错</h5>\n<p>现象：<br />\n页面加载 JavaScript 时出现类似：</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">$</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> d.audio.forEach</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> is</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> function</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>原因：</p>\n<p>ShokaX 的播放器代码会对 audio 配置执行：</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">audio.forEach</span><span style=\"color:#2993a3;--shiki-dark:#5eaab5\">(</span><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">...</span><span style=\"color:#2993a3;--shiki-dark:#5eaab5\">)</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>当配置中的 audio 为空值、格式不正确或者没有按照数组处理时，就可能导致这个问题。</p>\n<p>解决方法：</p>\n<p>关闭播放器功能，将<code>audio:</code>改成<code>audio: []</code>,同时关闭播放器：</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">modules:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">  player:</span><span style=\"color:#1E754F;--shiki-dark:#4D9375\"> false</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>也可以选择添加音乐。</p>\n<h3 id=\"butterfly-主题\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#butterfly-主题\">#</a> Butterfly 主题</h3>\n<p>除此之外，<a href=\"https://butterfly.js.org/\">Buttterfly主题</a>是比较流行一个选择，其文档也相对完善，可以参考<a href=\"https://butterfly.js.org/posts/21cfbf15\">官方安装文档</a>进行操作。</p>\n",
            "tags": []
        }
    ]
}